## Suggested levers

Catalogued levers whose user-scope saving reaches 0.5% of main token-turns (`MinBenefit`), ranked by that saving. Savings are ≈tokens from your own sessions; levers overlap, so they are never added up. Snippets use User, Local, Env or Flag scope only — never a committed project settings file, which would change the setting for every collaborator.

### 1. instructions: /home/zzuser/work/CLAUDE.md (Project)

- **Status:** UNVERIFIED: documented at https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory
- **Action:** exclude: a Project file above the project directory of every session that loaded it; exclude it there with the Local snippet.
- **Saving, user scope** (every decomposed session loading it): ≈3.1k tokens per call over 1 session (6 calls) · 18.6% of main token-turns.
- **Saving, project scope** (Local snippet, one per project; 1 project loaded it): ≈3.1k tokens per call over 1 session (6 calls) · 18.6% of main token-turns.
- **Snippets:**
  - Local (`.claude/settings.local.json`, gitignored): `"claudeMdExcludes": ["/home/zzuser/work/CLAUDE.md"]`
- **Trade-off:** Excluded files' instructions are lost; turning auto memory off also stops Claude from saving new memories
- **Docs:** https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory

### 2. disable-artifact: tool Artifact

- **Status:** VERIFIED 2.1.283 (gate 0): n=1 per mechanism; Local enableArtifact −13,382; env −11,740; flag −12,864; Local deny −12,866; ≈54.3k bytes removed
- **Saving, user scope** (every decomposed session carrying it): ≈788 tokens per call over 3 sessions (15 calls) · 11.7% of main token-turns.
- **Saving, project scope** (Local snippet, one per project; 2 projects never called it): ≈788 tokens per call over 3 sessions (15 calls) · 11.7% of main token-turns.
- **Usage:** called in 0 of 5 sessions, 0 projects, last used —.
- **Observed presence:** Artifact last sent on 2026-09-22 (Claude Code 2.1.283); absent from the 1 most recent session with a tool snapshot (1 project). Presence reflects past launches, not current settings.
- **Snippets:**
  - User (`~/.claude/settings.json`): `"enableArtifact": false` — no other settings file can re-enable it; delete this line to undo.
  - Local (`.claude/settings.local.json`, gitignored): `"enableArtifact": false` — no other settings file can re-enable it; delete this line to undo.
  - Env: `CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_ARTIFACT=1 claude`
  - Flag: `claude --disallowedTools Artifact`
- **Trade-off:** Claude can no longer publish pages; off wins everywhere (Local/Project honoured from 2.1.242)
- **Docs:** https://code.claude.com/docs/en/settings-reference

